ext":"value.mjs"},{"id":"spn-133524","text":" carries (alethic \"what can happen\"). Node confidence scores are the truth-degrees over which Value laws "},{"id":"spn-133525","marks":["code"],"text":"L1–L14"},{"id":"spn-133526","text":" range. "},{"id":"spn-133527","marks":["bold"],"text":"Already compliant"},{"id":"spn-133528","text":"; recommend citing the rung-1 correspondence in the "},{"id":"spn-133529","marks":["code"],"text":"Topology"},{"id":"spn-133530","text":" moduledoc so κ is understood as the alethic Value, not a bespoke metric."}]},{"id":"blk-71329","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-133531","text":"Rung 2 — axiological ("},{"id":"spn-133532","marks":["code"],"text":"score"},{"id":"spn-133533","text":") ◻ → name the semiring"}]},{"id":"blk-71330","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-133534","marks":["code"],"text":"lib/graphonomous/coverage.ex"},{"id":"spn-133535","text":" "},{"id":"spn-133536","marks":["code"],"text":"weighted_sum/2"},{"id":"spn-133537","text":" (line 604) computes "},{"id":"spn-133538","marks":["code"],"text":"Σ value × weight"},{"id":"spn-133539","text":" and clamps to "},{"id":"spn-133540","marks":["code"],"text":"[0,1]"},{"id":"spn-133541","text":". That is the kernel's "},{"id":"spn-133542","marks":["bold"],"text":"probability semiring"},{"id":"spn-133543","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-133544","marks":["code"],"text":"⊕ = +"},{"id":"spn-133545","text":", "},{"id":"spn-133546","marks":["code"],"text":"⊗ = ×"},{"id":"spn-133547","text":") from "},{"id":"spn-133548","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/score.mjs"},{"id":"spn-133549","text":". "},{"id":"spn-133550","marks":["bold"],"text":"Additive recommendation:"},{"id":"spn-133551","text":" document that the coverage score "},{"id":"spn-133552","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-133553","text":" the axiological rung in the probability semiring, and (optionally) expose a tropical ("},{"id":"spn-133554","marks":["code"],"text":"⊕ = min"},{"id":"spn-133555","text":") 