n rescue it). Graphonomous approximates this — "},{"id":"spn-133578","marks":["code"],"text":":escalate"},{"id":"spn-133579","text":" is terminal — but the relationship is implicit. "},{"id":"spn-133580","marks":["bold"],"text":"Additive recommendation:"},{"id":"spn-133581","text":" state in the "},{"id":"spn-133582","marks":["code"],"text":"Coverage"},{"id":"spn-133583","text":" moduledoc that a sub-floor signal annihilates to "},{"id":"spn-133584","marks":["code"],"text":":escalate"},{"id":"spn-133585","text":" (the deontic "},{"id":"spn-133586","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-133587","text":"), and add a property test mirroring the kernel's "},{"id":"spn-133588","marks":["code"],"text":"DB2"},{"id":"spn-133589","text":" annihilation law so the guarantee can't silently regress."}]},{"id":"blk-71335","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-133590","text":"Rung 4 — temporal (LTL ▸ supervise) ◻"}]},{"id":"blk-71336","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-133591","text":"Freshness/staleness decay ("},{"id":"spn-133592","marks":["code"],"text":"coverage.ex"},{"id":"spn-133593","text":" line 383) and consolidation cadence are time-aware, but there are no explicit LTL obligations (e.g. \"every stored contradiction is "},{"id":"spn-133594","marks":["italic"],"text":"eventually"},{"id":"spn-133595","text":" resolved\"). "},{"id":"spn-133596","marks":["bold"],"text":"Out of scope to add now"},{"id":"spn-133597","text":"; flagged as the natural next rung if temporal guarantees become first-class. Maps to "},{"id":"spn-133598","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/temporal.mjs"},{"id":"spn-133599","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-133600","marks":["code"],"text":"X"},{"id":"spn-133601","text":", "},{"id":"spn-133602","marks":["code"],"text":"◇"},{"id":"spn-133603","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-71337","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-133604","text":"Rung 6 — epistemic (knows ▸ believes) ✅ strongest"}]},{"id":"blk-71338","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-133